CPU-DIT-01 deterministic source corpus version 1.
This source is intentionally small: the reference generator combines each source
byte with a versioned counter-based stream derived from seed and global offset.
The corpus includes text, digits 0123456789, alternating symbols !@#$%^&*(), and
boundary markers [BEGIN-64B]......................................[END-64B].
All runtime payload bytes remain reproducible without storing a RAM-sized source.
